# Into the Beast's Maw (WotG 33), the whole run. In Xarcabard [S] Rally Point: Red shows JOIN_ALLIED_FORCE (02A
# messageSpecial 8277). Warped into Castle Zvahl Baileys [S] at Status 0: the zone-in plays 1, left open; its finish
# sets Status 1. The Peculiar Glint plays 2 [53, 23, 1756, 0, 0, 16384001]; its finish sets Status 2; the next tick
# shows the set-down: the 00B zone-out and the char at 183.405 -24.041 100.041 rot 126. The login plays 14, left open;
# its update with option 5 sends 05C [138, 23, 1756]; its finish sets Status 3; the next tick shows the 00B zone-out
# only (the same spot). The login plays 15; its finish gives the Distress Signal Flare and sets Status 4. With the flare
# the Ornate Block plays nothing of the mission's: its DefaultActions NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY (6409). The flare taken (a
# GM), Timer 0: the Block plays 11 [138]; finished with option 0, no flare; again, finished with option 1, the flare.
# The flare taken and Timer 1000000000 (GMs): the Block shows CANNOT_FIND_FLARE (027 messageName 7691, the flare 1239 as
# its parameter) and plays nothing (Lua returns true). Status 5 (a GM, for the instance no flow runs): the zone-in plays
# 3; its finish completes the mission (The Hunter Ensnared current, Status and Timer cleared).
lists XarcabardS/Rally_Point_Red/onTrigger CastleZvahlBaileysS/Ornate_Block/onTrigger CastleZvahlBaileysS/Peculiar_Glint/onTrigger CastleZvahlBaileysS/onZoneIn/1 CastleZvahlBaileysS/onEventUpdate/14 CastleZvahlBaileysS/onEventFinish/1 CastleZvahlBaileysS/onEventFinish/2 CastleZvahlBaileysS/onEventFinish/3 CastleZvahlBaileysS/onEventFinish/11 CastleZvahlBaileysS/onEventFinish/14 CastleZvahlBaileysS/onEventFinish/15
uncovered: 1/-/onEventFinish:10000 -- no flow statement starts 10000 here: its sender would be the Ghoyu's Reverie instance, which this tree does not have (the Lua's TODO; no script under scripts/zones/Ghoyus_Reverie starts an event), and the harness has no instance run; the finish (Status 5 and the set-down) is pinned by the fake check c3 T7 wotg 33 in tests/XI.Verify.Quests/C3ToauT7.cs
char zone=XarcabardS pos=-106.071,-25.5,-50 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg IntoTheBeastsMaw current
login
trigger Rally_Point_Red                    # JOIN_ALLIED_FORCE
warp 179.4,-24.1,98 CastleZvahlBaileysS open   # Status 0: 1
finish                                     # Status 1
trigger Peculiar_Glint                     # Status 1: 2
finish                                     # Status 2, set down
tick 400
login open                                 # 14
update 14 option=5                         # the update packet
finish                                     # Status 3, set down
tick 400
login open                                 # 15
finish                                     # the flare, Status 4
trigger Ornate_Block                       # the flare held: not the mission's
finish-if-event
delkeyitem DistressSignalFlare
trigger Ornate_Block                       # no flare, Timer 0: 11
finish option=0                            # no flare
trigger Ornate_Block                       # 11
finish option=1                            # the flare
delkeyitem DistressSignalFlare
charvar Mission[5][32]Timer 1000000000     # a GM: no script sets it
trigger Ornate_Block                       # Timer ahead: CANNOT_FIND_FLARE
charvar Mission[5][32]Status 5             # a GM: the instance's clear
rezone open                                # 3
finish                                     # completed
